msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eppure lei... ⟪k:1⟫continua ad andare dietro ad altri uomini—!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4C875E8F_EAB6_42A4_96A3_49E3618C9C8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7b86d12baa6d2bb02bb30e2831f5d01d8565b8c5c998707066e08c4206b31ce
